6. PROJECT FILE DIRECTORY
================================================================================

rov_ground_station_v1/
  |-- assets/                      Map files, vector icons & local tile cache
  |     |-- tiles/                 100% offline tiles (Satellite & Street Map)
  |     |-- map_view.html          Leaflet offline map container
  |     |-- leaflet.js             Bundled offline Leaflet script
  |     |-- leaflet.css            Bundled Leaflet stylesheet
  |     `-- rov_icon.png           Application icon
  |-- src/                         Source Code (Model-View-Controller)
  |     |-- config.py              Simulation parameters & physical constants
  |     |-- rov_simulator.py       [Model] Backend physics, drag & PD controllers
  |     |-- joystick_controller.py Plug-and-play USB gamepad input processor
  |     |-- ui_dashboard.py        Backward-compatibility view re-export
  |     `-- view/                  [View] Modular GUI components
  |           |-- dashboard.py     Master window shell & update loop
  |           |-- top_bar.py       Command ribbon, hold inputs & battery badge
  |           |-- left_panel.py    Speeds, thruster load bars & help box
  |           |-- right_panel.py   2D water column, depth plot & offline map
  |           |-- custom_widgets.py 2D QPainter canvas & CleanSpinBox
  |           `-- title_bar.py     Window controls
  |-- scripts/                     Launchers and cross-platform build scripts
  |     |-- run_linux.sh           1-click launcher for Linux / Ubuntu
  |     |-- run_windows.bat        1-click launcher for Windows
  |     |-- build_desktop_app.py   Standalone binary packaging script
  |     |-- download_offline_tiles.py Tool to cache dam reservoir map tiles
  |     `-- requirements.txt       Clean, minimal Python dependencies
  |-- main.py                      [Controller] Application entrypoint (20 Hz)
  `-- README                       This file (plain text documentation)


================================================================================
7. COMPILING STANDALONE BINARIES (FOR DEVELOPERS)
================================================================================

To package the application into a standalone executable that runs without
requiring Python installed on the target machine:

  python scripts/build_desktop_app.py

  * On Windows: Produces dist\ROVGroundStation\ROVGroundStation.exe
  * On Linux  : Produces dist/ROVGroundStation/ROVGroundStation


================================================================================
8. DEVELOPMENT & TEST ENVIRONMENT SYSTEM SPECIFICATIONS
================================================================================

This application was engineered, tested, and verified on the following hardware
and operating system environment:

  * Operating System      : Linux / Ubuntu
  * OS Version            : Ubuntu 24.04.5 LTS (Noble Numbat)
  * Linux Kernel          : 6.8.0-149-generic (x86_64)
  * Total System RAM      : 16 GB 
  * Processor (CPU)       : 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz 
  * Python Runtime        : Python 3.12.3 (GCC 13.3.0, 64-bit)
  * Graphical Framework   : PySide6 (Qt 6.7.x) & pyqtgraph (OpenGL/QtGraphics)


